  "rewardData": "Curious Backer__$1.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | I like this and I'll be back__$2.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | SUPPORT THE CAMPAIGN__$5.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | I Love Supporting Campaigns!!__$10.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | TWO Regular Size FiTow__$12.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | 5 Long FiTow - SHIPS WORLDWIDE__$45.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Business LUNCH__$300.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | Custom Order - FREE SHIPPING__$2,500.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | ",
