  "shortDescription": "The ultimate active towel that securely wraps around your neck without tying a knot or choker",
  "projectStory": "Project story\nCreator\nWorkout or Walkout, Inc.\nmore infocontact\nCategory\nHealth & Fitness\nTags\nsports\nBacking information\nCrowdfunding risks\nlearn more\nGet ALL the use of a regular towel and many MORE. It's so lightweight you can fold and put it in your pocket if you choose to, unlike the regular towel. Also, Get up to 40% OFF through Indiegogo Campaign.\nNo more tying a knot or a choker\nDon't leave your towel behind when you go running outdoors\nStop loosing towels frequently forgetting where you left it\nNo need to tuck it in and ruin the collar of your favorite T-Shirt\nWork in the garden or outdoors and move freely\nDo your Pre-workout stretch without having to put your towel away first\nOwn a High Quality, Quick Dry, Woven Suede Fabric Gym/Sports Towel\nThis towel is also Anti-Bacterial, Microfiber, Super Absorbent and Lightweight\nGo climb those rocks with your FiTow\nSuede material is very lightweight, yet more absorbent than regular Terry towel.\nThank you for taking the time to stop by, I'm the Founder/CEO of Workout or Walkout, Inc. I worked at various gyms prior to starting my Sporting Goods Company. I played college soccer, coached little leagues soccer, worked in other industry before joining the health & fitness industry.\nThis project is more than important to me because I currently live in south Florida where the weather is warm year round and sometimes I just want to trade a treadmill run for a jog at the park or even a walk without loosing my lightweight towel to the wind. This fitness towel will be able to stay in place when tucked into either side of its opening without having to tie a knot. Its efficiency helps reduce inconveniences and minimize lost while also being easily accessible for use.\nBefore filing for the patent, I had to work through every scenario to make sure it works as described. First, I created a prototype from an existing \"gym towel\" before making the actual product.\nThis is a simple yet an innovative idea that will change the way most gym towels are made. But it will not become a reality without your support.\nReaching our goal is just the first step to becoming the industry leader in this new category. Surpassing our goal will establish our brand in the market place. So get this towel that you know you need and in the process, proudly support the good causes that we are affiliated with.\n \nWhat We Need & What You Get\nOur goal is set low because we are past the production stage and are launching on Indiegogo at our introductory price for early birds.\nObviously the more order we get, the better and the more towels we can make for our customers.\nPick a perk of your choice or show your support through this campaign. Your support for our company is greatly appreciated.\nRisks & Challenges\nThe process is in place right this minute and we do not foresee any delays at this time. If there's anything of concern, we will be sure to update you and keep you posted.\nAbout the Founder\nWhen I started this company, I soon realized the market is tough and needed to figure out a way to stand out from the crowd besides the catchy name and logos. Being an inventor, turned CEO, I created a machine for abs that is currently not in the market but the cost of getting it ready for retail was extremely high. Out of frustration I decided to go for a 5mile jog to blow off steam. It was a bit windy out so I tucked in my gym towel underneath the collar of my T-shirt as always. The 5 miles was never completed, instead, I went back home to the drawing board where FiTow was born.\n  \nI'm the Founder/CEO of Workout or Walkout, Inc. (www.workoutorwalkout.com) and my goal in life is to leave the world a better place than it was when I came in.\nI've worked at other gyms prior to starting my Sporting Goods Company. And yes, I use to pickup towels daily from the treadmill handles and around the gym that people left behind.\nI've had experience in almost every position there in various works of life from ground level janitor to management including volunteering.\nMy consulting CFO has over 30 years experience and currently owns equity in the company so his drive for this to succeed is just as high as mine.\nI have great relationship with my manufacturers and they are always willing to go the extra mile if need be.\nMy work ethics is second to none. Currently, I will out work any employee any given day and always have period.\nMy drive for success is very personal. Obstacle is my favorite \"energy drink\" besides 5hr energy drink and sometimes coffee...lol.\nI love distractions and setbacks because it provides the opportunity to show my true commitment and resolution abilities. Besides, it's part of life so it's a take it or leave it situation from my point of view.\nOther Ways You Can Help\nSome people just can't contribute, but that doesn't mean they can't help:\nCan't get one? No worries, you can still make some noise about our campaign.\nI know you've heard about Facebook, Twitter, Instagram and so on. SHARE IT NOW!!!\nCheckout the Indiegogo share tools and put them to use!\nAnd that's all there is to it for now folks.Stay healthy my friends!!!",
